/></sources></patcit></patent-citations><non-patent-citations><nplcit status="new"><text>See also references of EP     1106939A1</text><sources><source name="SEA" created-by-npl="N"/></sources></nplcit></non-patent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>LONGWELL JAPAN CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKACHI KEN</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>LONGWELL JAPAN CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKACHI, KEN</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>TAKACHI KEN</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>TAKACHI, KEN</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A cooling device capable of eliminating various problems such as poor economy and cool air pulsation, wherein a compressor and an expansion machine are connected to a crank shaft or crank shafts interlocked with each other, and the expansion energy of compressed air from the expansion machine is utilized as an energy to compress fresh air by the compressor so as to reduce a running cost, a plurality of expansion machines are operated at a specified phase difference so as to reduce the pulsation of the cool air, an air dryer is installed in a pipe for introducing air into the expansion machine so as to dehumidify non-expanded air, and the crank equipment of the compressor and expansion machine are desirably those provided with a planetary gear mechanism.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispositif de refroidissement capable de palier à différents problèmes dont le coût et l'impulsion d'air frais comprenant un compresseur et une machine d'expansion reliés à un(des) arbre(s) à vilebrequin asservis. L'énergie d'expansion de l'air comprimé s'écoulant de la machine d'expansion sert d'énergie pour comprimer l'air frais de manière à réduire le coût de fonctionnement. Une pluralité de machines d'expansion sont mises en route à des phases différentes dans le but de réduire l'impulsion d'air frais et un sécheur d'air est installé dans un tube recevant l'air et l'envoyant vers la machine d'expansion. Ainsi, l'air non dilaté est séché et l'équipement à vilebrequin du compresseur et de la machine correspondent à ceux inclus dans un mécanisme d'engrenage planétaire.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>